<title>POLAND: KGHM to start continuous trade July 17.</title>
<headline>KGHM to start continuous trade July 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish copper giant KGHM Polska Miedz SA will start Warsaw bourse continuous trade on July 17, a bourse deputy president said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Wlodzimierz Magiera told a news conference that the stock would start live trade in blocks of 250 shares.</p>
<p>KGHM started trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on Thursday at 23.5 zlotys, 11.9 percent above its institutional investor issue price.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
